{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 24, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the land of the rising sun, a journey thou shalt embark\nTo behold the beauty of Japan, and to leave one's mark\n\nIn the city of Tokyo, thy adventure starts\nWhere ancient customs blend with modern arts\nExplore the Sensoji Temple, and marvel at its age\nPay respects to the gods, on its hallowed stage\n\nWander through the Shibuya Crossing, a sight to behold\nWhere countless souls tread, a story to be told\nView the cherry blossoms in Ueno Park, a sight to grace\nAdmire their fleeting beauty, in this serene space\n\nJourney to Hakone, and behold its hot springs\nSoak in the waters, and let all worries spring\nVisit the Hakone Shrine, and pay homage to the god\nWhere peace and tranquility, are bestowed\n\nIn Kyoto, the former capital, of emperors of yore\nDiscover the Fushimi Inari Shrine, with its thousand torii doors\nAdmire the Golden Pavilion, its reflection on the pond\nAnd ponder on the fleeting nature of life, as time is bond\n\nIn Nara, meet the friendly deer, in the park they roam\nAnd visit the Todaiji Temple, where the Great Buddha is enthroned\n\nIn Hiroshima, remember those who perished in the blast\nAnd pray for peace, may it forever last\n\nReturn to Tokyo, and bid farewell to this land\nWith memories to cherish, and stories to be canned\n\nGo forth, and explore this wondrous place\nAnd let thy journey, unveil its grace.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.16018113493919373}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.013940464705228806}, {"token": "land", "logprob": -2.195058584213257}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.08377084881067276}, {"token": "rising", "logprob": -0.005954977124929428}, {"token": "sun", "logprob": -1.8954096958623268e-05}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.6676167845726013}, {"token": "a", "logprob": -0.11934901028871536}, {"token": "journey", "logprob":